---
import catalog from '../../../data/martin/index.mjs';

const treatments = {
  '20.1': '平衡位置、能量 Hessian、质量加权动力学矩阵、Bloch 模式、声学/光学支与长程项 | Equilibrium, energy Hessian, mass-weighted dynamical matrix, Bloch modes, acoustic/optic branches, and long-range terms',
  '20.2': '有限位移、超胞、位移幅度、力常数范围、冻结场与冻结自旋螺旋 | Finite displacements, supercells, amplitude choice, force-constant range, frozen fields, and frozen spin spirals',
  '20.3': '二阶能量导数、密度响应、介电矩阵、独立粒子响应及空带求和代价 | Second energy derivatives, density response, dielectric matrices, independent-particle response, and empty-state cost',
  '20.4': '一阶轨道/密度、屏蔽势、投影 Sternheimer 方程和自洽迭代 | First-order orbitals/density, screened potential, projected Sternheimer equation, and self-consistent iteration',
  '20.5': '二阶响应泛函、约束极小化、驻点误差和线性方程等价性 | Second-order response functional, constrained minimization, stationary error, and equivalence to the linear equation',
  '20.6': '给定 q 的周期微扰、k 到 k+q 混合、晶胞周期响应与 FFT 实现 | Periodic perturbation at q, k-to-k+q mixing, cell-periodic response, and FFT implementation',
  '20.7': '宏观电场、位置矩阵元、非局域修正、Born 有效电荷与非解析长程项 | Macroscopic fields, position matrix elements, nonlocal corrections, Born effective charges, and nonanalytic long-range terms',
  '20.8': '屏蔽电子—声子矩阵元、Fermi 面积分、Eliashberg 谱、lambda 与 Tc 证据边界 | Screened electron–phonon matrix elements, Fermi-surface integration, Eliashberg spectrum, lambda, and Tc evidence limits',
  '20.9': '冻结磁振子、广义 Bloch 定理、动态自旋响应、谱峰和阻尼 | Frozen magnons, generalized Bloch theorem, dynamic spin response, spectral peaks, and damping',
};

const unit = catalog.parts[4].units[1];
---

<h2 id="source-map">来源地图 | Source Map</h2>

<div class="chapter20-source-table chapter-source-map">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">节 | Section</th>
        <th scope="col">Martin 原节标题 | Martin title</th>
        <th scope="col">印刷页 | Print page</th>
        <th scope="col">本站处理 | Website treatment</th>
        <th scope="col">状态 | Status</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {unit.sections.map((section) => (
        <tr>
          <td><code>{section.id}</code></td>
          <td>{section.title}</td>
          <td>{section.page}</td>
          <td>{treatments[section.id]}</td>
          <td>active draft</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<p>
  【Martin 原书 | Martin source】目录和印刷页码来自 Martin 第 2 版 Chapter 20，印刷页 427–444。原书习题从印刷页 444 开始；本站不转录原书正文、图、图注、习题或答案。
</p>
<p lang="en">
  【Martin source】The structure and printed-page locators follow Martin, 2nd ed., Chapter 20, pp. 427–444. The source exercises begin on printed p. 444; this site reproduces neither source prose, figures, captions, exercises, nor answers.
</p>

<p>
  【外部权威来源 | External source】Sholl–Steckel Chapter 5 用于有限位移的实践误差：位移过大引入非谐性，位移过小使能量或力差落入数值噪声。Martin Appendix D、E 提供响应函数与介电长程项；其他附录只在当前推导需要时引用。
</p>
<p lang="en">
  【External source】Sholl–Steckel Chapter 5 supplies the practical finite-displacement error balance: large displacements introduce anharmonicity, whereas very small displacements place energy or force differences below the numerical noise floor. Martin Appendices D and E support response functions and long-range dielectric terms; other appendices are used only where a derivation requires them.
</p>
